    "summary": "Slip catalogue:\r\nSmall box of hard dark wood, in the shape of a water-bottle, with a flat bottom. To aid in the perforation a circular hole has been made in the bottom and refilled by a disc of wood. Ornamented on side by a broad vertical band of zig-zag on one side and half a similar band on the other. Split at the neck which is surrounded by a thin string to which is attached a string of light blue, pink and red beads.  Lime-box, for lime to be chewed with tobacco.",
